WEBVTT

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:32.000
and their desire to live
in peace and harmony.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:38.140
In October 2003, over 6,000 runners

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:41.030
from 49 different nationalities

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:45.010
came to the start line, all determined,

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:47.180
and when the gunfire went off,

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:52.180
this time it was a signal
to run in harmony,

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.240
for a change.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.050
The marathon grew.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.060
So did our political problems.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:02.160
But for every disaster we had,